WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.403 --> 00:00:04.587
Unit five. Life Skills for Independent Living!

2
00:00:05.531 --> 00:00:09.137
Hello, everyone! I'm Doctor Sokha, your school doctor.

3
00:00:09.187 --> 00:00:12.079
Hi, Doctor Sokha! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:12.129 --> 00:00:17.240
Today we learn about Life Skills for Independent Living. Let's go!

5
00:00:19.527 --> 00:00:24.394
Independent living. Say it with me. Independent living!

6
00:00:27.917 --> 00:00:32.350
Budgeting for health. Say it with me. Budgeting for health!

7
00:00:35.874 --> 00:00:40.174
Meal preparation. Say it with me. Meal preparation!

8
00:00:43.626 --> 00:00:47.976
Time management. Say it with me. Time management!

9
00:00:51.570 --> 00:00:56.403
Self-sufficiency. Say it with me. Self-sufficiency!

10
00:00:59.861 --> 00:01:05.478
Health insurance choice. Say it with me. Health insurance choice!

11
00:01:08.929 --> 00:01:14.446
Personal responsibility. Say it with me. Personal responsibility!

12
00:01:17.967 --> 00:01:22.417
Adulting skill. Say it with me. Adulting skill!

13
00:01:25.929 --> 00:01:42.933
Independent living requires budgeting for health needs and basic meal preparation skills. Good time management supports self-sufficiency as a young adult. Understanding a health insurance choice is an important adulting skill tied to personal responsibility.

14
00:01:42.983 --> 00:01:46.261
Now I understand. Thank you, Doctor Sokha!

15
00:01:47.032 --> 00:01:52.426
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:52.476 --> 00:01:54.065
Meal preparation!

17
00:01:55.111 --> 00:02:00.561
Look! What's the word?

18
00:02:00.611 --> 00:02:02.630
Personal responsibility!

19
00:02:03.486 --> 00:02:10.815
Did you know? Learning to cook just a few basic, healthy meals can significantly improve a young adult's diet and budget.

20
00:02:10.865 --> 00:02:12.967
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:02:14.164 --> 00:02:23.482
Think and answer. What life skill do you feel most prepared for as you become an adult?

22
00:02:23.532 --> 00:02:24.682
Great answer!

23
00:02:25.780 --> 00:02:31.339
Great job today! Stay healthy, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
00:02:31.389 --> 00:02:34.200
Goodbye, everyone! Stay healthy!

